<title>USA: Carrollton, Texas, won by William Hough.</title>
<headline>Carrollton, Texas, won by William Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Hough said it won $7.050 million of Carrollton, Texas, general obligation limited tax bonds, Sereis 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
